.org/wiki/Kellenech_Technologies?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Sentinel Droid was designed for personal security, but it is also used for other purposes. Though many models of this Droid can be found throughout the galaxy, the Mark I version of the Sentinel Droid is by far the most common. With a humanoid structure and a solid physical build, the Sentinel Droid can be an imposing figure for anyone who goes up against it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, unlike other combat-capable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", the Sentinel Droid functions best when used in large numbers, similar to the Battle Droids that would become popular thousands of years later during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". Though a single Kellenech Sentinel Droid might not be much of a threat, a half dozen of the Sentinel Droids can be a dangerous security detail. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mark I Sentinel Droids can be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sentinel Droid Mark I Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n","Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, ",{